  "description": "Lee Yu-Ri studies as the successor of the incense shop, her family's business has been passed down from generation to generation. She rejected the love of her smug classmate, but ends up being bullied by the boy's gang at school. One day, she was running away from the man who was bothering her and went to the mountain. But suddenly a tin fell from the sky and hit Yu-Ri's head which killed her immediately. Yu-Ri thought she was dead, but when she opened her eyes, she was already on the lap of a handsome man named So-Woo! And the man called her Lady.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated) \n\n*Note: Includes six extra chapters.*",
